menu "Player core effects"

    config FX_VELVET_ROOM
        bool "velvet room reverb (heavy; measured first)"
        default n
        help
            Adds the velvet-noise feedback-delay-network reverb "velvet_room" to the effect chain, between the
            freeverb reverb and the limiter. It is a heavy effect (one of the cost classes the chain suspends
            while the Bluetooth link needs the CPU) and is left out until the board measurements say it fits.

endmenu
